{
  "_readme": [
    "Per-set One Piece pull rates, as cards PER CASE, from tcgtrading.cards.",
    "They are derived from how a sealed case is collated — a case is 12 boxes and each",
    "box carries a known set of guaranteed hits — which is a real structural constraint",
    "rather than a survey. The site is explicit that they are approximations calibrated",
    "to community-reported box guarantees; Bandai publishes nothing.",
    "",
    "A case is 12 boxes of 24 packs, so per-pack = perCase / 288.",
    "",
    "REFRESHING: the site answers scripted requests with 429 no matter the headers, so",
    "these cannot be curled. Open a set page in a browser and read the JSON-LD block:",
    "  fetch('/one-piece-tcg/sets/op16/box-ev').then(r=>r.text()).then(h=>",
    "    [...h.matchAll(/\"name\":\"([^\"]+?) per case\",\"value\":([\\d.]+)/g)].map(m=>[m[1],+m[2]]))",
    "These are collation figures, not prices — they do not move day to day."
  ],
  "packsPerCase": 288,
  "source": "https://www.tcgtrading.cards/one-piece-tcg/sets/{code}/box-ev",
